      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying an overwhelming amount of guilt right now, and that burden is incredibly heavy. Please remember that your struggles are part of your life, not something you are *causing* for your children. Children feel their parents' love and care, even when those parents are struggling; they don't view you as a weight. Seeking support for yourself is actually the most loving thing you can do for them right now.",
